Sugrīva sends Śatabali north with hundred thousand monkeys --- Monkeys search Mlēccha Kuru Cīna Darada Himavat forests --- Monkeys visit Sōma hermitage Kāla Sudarśana void Kailāsa --- Monkeys search Kubēra palace Nalinī lake Guhyaka hills --- Monkeys enter dread Krauñca cave honoring sunlike sages --- Monkeys search Maināka Maya palace horse-faced women --- Monkeys greet Vaikhānasa ascetics asking Sītā tidings --- Monkeys cross dark sky Śailōdā bamboo ferry to Uttara Kurus --- Monkeys scan wish-tree lands music-filled golden rivers --- Monkeys behold Sōmagiri Brahmā abode then swiftly return
